    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot Wax is a falling-block puzzle game where you place candles and then light them up to create slowly-unfolding chain reactions in a gloomy temple built to some unholy creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in  six different gamemodes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ritual reach a set score to summon the temple's god.   <br>In Penance clear a growing number of candle blocks in as few turns as possible<br>In Eternal play until the board fills up.   <br>In Glory place a number of candles then burn as many as you can with just one flame.   <br>In Slow-Burn train to mastery while the speed stays constant.<br>And in Service, play a new challenge every day and compete against the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the first 4 gamemodes has 3 different difficulties. All the gamemodes contribute towards unlocking the 30 colour palettes available in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run typically lasts a couple of minutes. The game can be played with either a keyboard or with a game controller.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot Wax is a falling-block puzzle game where you place candles and then light them up to create slowly-unfolding chain reactions in a gloomy temple built to some unholy creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in  six different gamemodes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ritual reach a set score to summon the temple's god.   <br>In Penance clear a growing number of candle blocks in as few turns as possible<br>In Eternal play until the board fills up.   <br>In Glory place a number of candles then burn as many as you can with just one flame.   <br>In Slow-Burn train to mastery while the speed stays constant.<br>And in Service, play a new challenge every day and compete against the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the first 4 gamemodes has 3 different difficulties. All the gamemodes contribute towards unlocking the 30 colour palettes available in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run typically lasts a couple of minutes. The game can be played with either a keyboard or with a game controller.</p>",
